      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c9c38d3f6dbdf157dcd507a|full_name}: yes the \"There was an error sending the report\" message can appear because of it. Not sure if this is the only reason causing the error as of yet tho.\n\nIf you wanna make sure that your in-game reports actually went through, log into the vrchat website and then go to:\n\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/api/1/users/insert your user-id here/feedback\n\nIt will list all the reports/feedbacks you have given.",
