  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems like the player report system sometimes struggles to grab the necessary information needed to send off the API request. For now I could not find a consistent way of replicating it as the player reports after the error went through without a problem.\n\nEDIT #1: Quick update as it happened again, this time with a different error in the output logs. I am going to update this as soon as it happens again with a different error.\n\nEDIT #2: Since Build 860 has been released the report issue has been resolved.",
